OL,3,GNEWSAI fix cars for a living and put
OL,4,Aout fires in my spare time
OL,5,
OL,6,FBy day, 20-year-old Tyrell Cambridge
OL,7,Fspends his hours fixing vehicles, but
OL,8,Fwhen the tools are down, he swaps the
OL,9,Fworkshop for the fire station.
OL,11,FVolunteering as a firefighter for the
OL,12,FPeterborough Volunteer Fire Brigade
OL,13,F(PVFB), he never knows when he will be
OL,14,Fdeployed on a job.
OL,16,FHis interest in firefighting stretches
OL,17,Fback to childhood. Growing up, he was
OL,18,Ffascinated by toy fire engines and
OL,19,Fseeing local fire crews tackle blazes.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
