OL,3,GNEWSAI fix cars for a living and put
OL,4,Aout fires in my spare time
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It fills you with this big rush of
OL,7,Fadrenaline and all of the way to the
OL,8,Fstation you're thinking what could it
OL,9,Fbe," he said.
